From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Zager <szager@chromium.org>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 10:37:10 -0700
Subject: [HiC] Fix slot assignment iteration during SetIsInCanvasSubtree

Slot assignments can be synchronously recalculated during the call to
child->SetIsInCanvasSubtree(), so we operate on a copy of the assigned
nodes. It's OK if the nodes in the vector become stale; any nodes
added or removed from the slot's assigned_nodes_ vector will update
their IsInCanvasSubtree bit in FlatTreeParentChanged() or
RemovedFromFlatTree().

Fixed: 572237023
Change-Id: Ic809f6c2cf202861b123435ab52afedd6c687e27
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8564744
Commit-Queue: Stefan Zager <szager@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Stephen Chenney <schenney@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1717573}

Electron adaptation notes (45-x-y): html_canvas_element_test.cc: the new SlotAssignmentDuringSetIsInCanvasSubtree test was appended by hand next to tests added by earlier Electron backports at the same location; element.cc merged cleanly.

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/dom/element.cc b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/dom/element.cc
index 42f83455771118d7bcca15ef21191764ca561cbc..6a085e19b60cf2eaf03a5db141340aec63fb4b87 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/dom/element.cc
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/dom/element.cc
@@ -4444,7 +4444,8 @@ void Element::VerifySubtreeIsInCanvas(bool value) {
   } else if (auto* slot = ToHTMLSlotElementIfSupportsAssignmentOrNull(*this);
              slot && !slot->AssignedNodesNoRecalc().empty()) {
     for (Node* node : slot->AssignedNodesNoRecalc()) {
-      if (auto* child = DynamicTo<Element>(node)) {
+      if (auto* child = DynamicTo<Element>(node);
+          child && child->AssignedSlotWithoutRecalc() == slot) {
         child->VerifySubtreeIsInCanvas(value);
       }
     }
@@ -4498,8 +4499,11 @@ void Element::SetIsInCanvasSubtree(bool value) {
       child.SetIsInCanvasSubtree(value);
     }
   } else if (auto* slot = ToHTMLSlotElementIfSupportsAssignmentOrNull(*this)) {
-    for (Node* node : slot->AssignedNodesNoRecalc()) {
-      if (auto* child = DynamicTo<Element>(node)) {
+    const HeapVector<Member<Node>> assigned_nodes =
+        slot->AssignedNodesNoRecalc();
+    for (Node* node : assigned_nodes) {
+      if (auto* child = DynamicTo<Element>(node);
+          child && child->AssignedSlotWithoutRecalc() == slot) {
         child->SetIsInCanvasSubtree(value);
       }
     }
